First up, the merchandise!

885
01:02:15,597 --> 01:02:20,897
We have the Acrylic Diorama StandRyS, illustrated by Ninunonipisuke-sensei.

886
01:02:20,897 --> 01:02:23,897
The ChibiRyS Tote Bag, illustrated by Lian-sensei.

887
01:02:23,897 --> 01:02:29,197
The Race QueenRyS Keychain, which is a really cute race queen plushie keychain,

888
01:02:29,197 --> 01:02:31,897
And the YabaiRyS Pouch.

889
01:02:31,897 --> 01:02:38,197
For full set bonuses, the limited edition includes a postcard with a handwritten message and a foil-stamped autograph.

890
01:02:38,197 --> 01:02:42,397
The standard version includes a postcard with both a foil-stamped message and autograph.

891
01:02:42,397 --> 01:02:48,397
The sales will start at 1:15 PM, which is like real soon, if not maybe even now!

